# Project-Local Paths Only

Do **not** include directory or file paths that lie **outside the root of this project** in:

- **Plan documents** (e.g. under `.cursor/plans/`)
- **Any code in this repository**, including **string literals, config values, and comments**

**Do:**
- Use **paths relative to the repo root** for anything inside the project (e.g. `controller/admin/advance.php`, `.cursor/rules/foo.mdc`).
- Refer to external things **without** filesystem paths (e.g. “host Docker volume”, “system PHP ini”, “global editor settings”, “user home directory”).

**Do not:**
- Paste **absolute paths** (`C:\...`, `/home/...`, `~/...`) or paths under **other trees** (user profile, Cursor project cache outside this repo, sibling folders, other drives)—including in comments or documentation strings committed here.
- Embed **machine- or user-specific** locations that are not inside this repository.

If an external location must be discussed, use **generic terms** only—no literal paths outside the project root.
